1782160156909977	vessel-dev	itc:v3:AWLJkn-SeSTkkkQAAAAAQdav9XquqoAAAAEyJQ		item.create	bn-1wr	{"description":"Security scan (csf_534b00b93840a03d, Medium/P2) found unbounded JSON IPC frames at src/server/mod.rs:317 (read_line accumulates without cap) and unbounded base64 decode of SendBytes.data at src/protocol.rs:502. A same-user/spawned-agent socket client can exhaust server memory (DoS of control plane). Fix: bounded FrameReader (1 MiB cap) replacing read_line; independent decoded-size guard in base64_bytes::deserialize. Add tests.","kind":"task","title":"Fix CWE-400: bound IPC frame + SendBytes payload size"}	blake3:v-orCv5JAhzqJYLmq1V8giIjYKRoypCZheyBexS-VZs
